  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 414.01 Permits, When Necessary.\n\n(a) Pursuant to RSA 270-D:4, a person shall obtain a permit from the commissioner to engage in the following activities:\n\n(1) Waterski slalom;\n\n(2) Waterski jump;\n\n(3) Fishing tournament or derby;\n\n(4) Waterski show;\n\n(5) Boat races;\n\n(6) Boat parade;\n\n(7) Parasailing; or\n\n(8) Other water event.\n\n(b) An application for a permit shall be obtained by calling the division at (603) 293-0091 or in writing to the following:\n\nDepartment of Safety\n\nBureau of Marine Patrol\n\n31 Dock Road\n\nGilford, NH 03249-7627\n\nSource. #5448, eff 8-24-92; amd by #5862, eff 7-1-94; ss by #6005, eff 3-24-95, EXPIRED: 3-24-03\n\nNew. #7904, INTERIM, eff 6-24-03, EXPIRED: 12-21-03\n\nNew. #8107, EMERGENCY, eff 6-22-04, EXPIRES: 12-19-04; ss by #8172, eff 9-21-04; (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading) renumbered by #9544 (formerly Saf-C 413.01); ss by #10293, eff 3-20-13",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c400.html"
